{"overview":"آی دختر دبیرستانی است که تحت فشارهای اجتماعی خفه می‌شود، اما برای مقابله با جریان عمومی سخت می‌گیرد. یک روز، به‌طور عجیب و غریبی افراد مدرسه‌اش شروع به ساختن هرم انسانی می‌کنند. مدیر و معلمان دیگر رفتار عجیبی نشان می‌دهند و شرکت در این هرم را تشویق می‌کنند و ترکیب‌های ورزشی به شهر گسترش می‌یابند. در نهایت فقط آی و یو، دانش‌آموز انتقالی که در جا گرفتن مشکل دارد، برای مقابله با این دیوانگی همسان‌سازی باقی می‌مانند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ai is a high school girl who feels suffocated by social pressure, but finds it hard to fight going with the flow. One day, the people in her school inexplicably start to form a human pyramid. The principal and other teachers start to act weird and encourage taking part in it, and the various gymnastic formations start to spread and take over the whole town. Eventually only Ai and Yuu, a transfer student who finds it hard to fit in, are left to rebel against the conformity madness.","tagline_en":"","runtime":82,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["下津優太"],"crew_en":["Yûta Shimotsu"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山田杏奈","role":"Ai","photo":"/2cCWdsCpZbG67HJ96QdI9VVvh0G.jpg","en":"Anna Yamada"},{"name":"青木柚","role":"Yuu","photo":"/xZdmoDei5fxBruGtpy9I01XV4aF.jpg","en":"Yuzu Aoki"},{"name":"ピエール瀧","role":"Principal","photo":"/nIgFcU0smYH7FdzUt96d685uU1h.jpg","en":"Pierre Taki"},{"name":"駒井蓮","role":"","photo":"/lqNVytUK3Pa5QND6LZZv7twmbuw.jpg","en":"Ren Komai"},{"name":"Danhi Kinoshita","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"佐々木ありさ","role":"","photo":"/n7SXQAx9h6v6HLK7bzCfjSLPjsu.jpg","en":"Arisa Sasaki"},{"name":"ロジャース歌乃","role":"","photo":"","en":"Kano Rogers"},{"name":"細井じゅん","role":"","photo":"/3Uza3qtzOOTHoyhBw3WjQ5H9DLb.jpg","en":"Jun Hosoi"},{"name":"Ryo Matsumoto","role":"","photo":"/iFeVMnLT4qSEU5d8Olzt9ZvQOyD.jpg"},{"name":"足立智充","role":"Ai's Father","photo":"/oHl0D6F1FBH0Y3IvZT7quWhoGmk.jpg","en":"Tomomitsu Adachi"},{"name":"坂倉なつこ","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"清水崇","role":"","photo":"/krjo0